# Pairs with FailClosed. Discovery offers lattice_capabilities to a session
# with no resolved credential, so an anonymous caller is offered a tool.
MODULE: MetaToolOfferedToAnonymous
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the session configurator installs the meta-tool whether or not the caller is authenticated
PERTURBS: OpenSession

--- FIND
        meta == IF c \in Authenticated THEN {"caps"} ELSE {}
--- REPLACE
        meta == {"caps"}
--- END
